:: MP RelDay Noel 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to ($mpNpcs.noel or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if Time.dayState is "dusk" or Time.dayState is "night">>暮色四合的玻璃花房里，<<else>>水雾氤氲的玻璃花房深处，<</if>>诺艾尔捧出一盆罕见的并蒂银脉兰。她红着耳根把一枚压着双生花瓣的琥珀书签递给你：「这是今年开得最好的一朵，我想留给你。」
花房墙角的恒温阀手轮上系着一条红布条。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>><<link [[告别诺艾尔返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">告别诺艾尔返回 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_noel_8 is 1>>
今天已聊得尽兴，先回吧。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-noel-8">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "替并蒂兰培上腐殖细土 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-noel-8">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_noel_8 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_noel_8")>><<money 650>>银脉兰在温润水雾中泛起柔和微光，诺艾尔鼓起勇气牵住你的手，把花房津贴分给你。<<else>>银脉兰在温润水雾中泛起柔和微光，诺艾尔轻轻牵住了你的手指。<</if>><span class="green">花叶清香伴着她轻柔的心跳声。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好书签返回 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	陶铲不小心碰到了兰花气根，惊得你忙缩回手。<span class="red">诺艾尔扶住你的手腕一起把气根理顺。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[放轻陶铲重新培土 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回花房外廊 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "打开恒温阀为花房锁暖气 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-noel-8">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_noel_8 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_noel_8_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>暖水顺着铜管缓缓流过花架，诺艾尔依偎在你肩旁，将标本稿酬塞进你掌心。<<else>>暖水顺着铜管缓缓流过花架，诺艾尔安心地依偎在你肩旁。<</if>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>><span class="green">玻璃穹顶下的暖意驱散了所有寒凉。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[温存片刻后离开 (0:04)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜阀旋钮有些烫手，拧动时磨红了虎口。<span class="red">你垫上亚麻巾准备再拧一次。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫厚亚麻巾再旋铜阀 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回公园主路 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[改日再访 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

