	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他巡完后半夜街区 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	重心转得急了些，脚踝在胶垫上崴了一下。<span class="red">林恩眼疾手快一把托住你的腰。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[站稳步子重新拆招 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先坐木箱上歇息 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拿软毛刷替他给护腕上蜡 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-lin-7">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_lin_7 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>皮革吸饱蜂蜡后柔韧光亮，林恩低头替你扣好领口防风扣，动作轻柔得不像拳手。<span class="green">硬朗眉眼间全是对你的护惜。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[随他出巷口夜巡 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
