:: MP RelDay Monet 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.hour gte 20>>夜深后的天鹅绒画室落下了长帘，<<else>>谢绝访客后的私密画室里，<</if>>莫奈掀开主画架上的丝绸罩布——画布上是你在暖光下回眸的肖像。她取出一枚镶嵌紫水晶的银裁缝剪挂坠放进你掌心：「我的画与心，都只为你落笔。」
画架旁立着一只尚未上漆的胡桃木画框。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[告别莫奈离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">告别莫奈离开 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
