:: MP RelDay Ash 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>林间细雨沾湿了青苔石阶，<<else>>深林树影穿过茂密的树冠，<</if>>阿什正带着猎犬修补石屋后方的防风木篱。看见你走来，他把一双厚实的鹿皮手套递给你：「山里起了风，帮我把这几根松木桩绑牢。」

