	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[入夜留下来围炉夜话 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	松木树皮粗糙，隔着手套仍硌痛了虎口。<span class="red">阿什接过麻绳替你收紧最后一扣。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[戴稳鹿皮手套再绑 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回石屋廊下 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
