<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "day" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>午后的多瑙河宅邸阳光房里，<<else>>恒温舒适的多瑙河宅邸偏厅里，<</if>>艾弗里正在审阅拍卖行送来的古董折扇图录。见你走进来，他拍了拍身旁的真皮沙发：「过来坐我身边，挑一把你看着顺眼的拍品。」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:03)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_avery_6 is 1>>
今日已整理妥帖，改日再来。
<br>
<<link [[顺路继续查探 (0:04)|MP Daily Avery 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-avery-6">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "指点图录上那把象牙雕花扇 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-avery-6">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_avery_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</if>>艾弗里满意地用金笔圈下编号，顺势揽住你的腰际夸赞你的眼光愈发老道。<span class="green">他看你的眼神满是宠溺与占有。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[留到晚间陪他小酌 (0:04)|MP Daily Avery 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	图录纸页光滑，金笔尖在页脚洇出一小点墨迹。<span class="red">艾弗里拿吸墨纸替你轻轻按干。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压稳图录重新勾画 (0:04)|MP Daily Avery 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回门厅外 (0:03)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "端纯银茶壶替他斟满红茶 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-avery-6">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_avery_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</if>>佛手柑茶香袅袅升起，艾弗里握住你执壶的手指轻轻摩挲，神色彻底放松下来。<span class="green">唯有在你面前他才会卸下商场锋芒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[约定夜里去书房相伴 (0:04)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	纯银壶柄导热颇快，烫得你指尖微缩。<span class="red">你折好餐巾裹住壶柄准备再斟。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[裹好餐巾重新斟茶 (0:04)|MP Daily Avery 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回花园回廊 (0:03)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Avery 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>夜色笼罩的多瑙河宅邸书房里，<<else>>安静私密的多瑙河宅邸书房内，<</if>>壁炉火光映着红木书桌，艾弗里取出一枚刻有家族纹章的纯金书签与一叠零用金券放进你手里：「以后这间宅邸的门，任何时候都为你敞开。」
