	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<npcincr Avery love 2>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_avery_7")>><<money 450>>艾弗里顺势将你拉坐在膝头，低头吻过你的发鬓，将金券塞进你手包。<<else>>艾弗里顺势将你拉坐在膝头，低头吻过你的发鬓，神色舒展。<</if>><span class="green">华贵书房里流淌着独属于你们的温存。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
