	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好金券返回街上 (0:04)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	丝绸领结扣得略紧，解开时勾住了你袖口的蕾丝。<span class="red">艾弗里低笑一声替你解开袖口。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[放慢指尖重新解扣 (0:04)|MP Daily Avery 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回书房外 (0:03)|Danube Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "陪他站落地窗前俯瞰夜景 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-avery-7">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
