	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<npcincr Avery love 2>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_avery_7_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>夜风吹动窗纱，艾弗里从身后拥住你，将准备好的纪念胸针放进你衣袋。<<else>>夜风轻轻吹动窗纱，艾弗里从身后拥住你，陪你俯瞰庭院灯火。<</if>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>><span class="green">并肩静立的时刻胜过千言万语。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
