:: MP Daily Sydney 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "morning" or Time.dayState is "day">>晨光透过神殿彩绘玻璃窗，<<else>>祈祷课结束后的神殿香室里，<</if>>悉尼正在长桌前按月份分拣信徒奉纳的祈愿木牌。看见你进来，他眼睛一亮，忙挪开半张木凳：「快来帮我穿红绳，坐我旁边就好。」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿前庭 (0:03)|Temple]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_sydney_6 is 1>>
今日已巡看过，明日再来吧。
<br>
<<link [[顺路继续查探 (0:04)|MP Daily Sydney 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-sydney-6">
<<templeicon>><<link "帮他把红丝绳穿过木牌圆孔 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-sydney-6">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_sydney_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>>百余枚木牌串得整整齐齐，悉尼欢喜地蹭了蹭你的肩膀，塞给你一颗薄荷糖。<span class="green">彩窗光影下他的笑容纯净而温暖。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[傍晚去图书馆陪他值班 (0:04)|MP Daily Sydney 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	红丝绳尾散了线，卡在木孔里没能穿过去。<span class="red">悉尼握住你的手指一起用蜂蜡捻尖绳头。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[捻尖红绳重新穿孔 (0:04)|MP Daily Sydney 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回神殿长廊 (0:03)|Temple]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用软毛刷替他扫木牌积灰 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-sydney-6">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_sydney_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>>木牌字迹清晰重现，悉尼感激地看着你，悄悄在桌下勾住了你的小指。<span class="green">庄严圣殿里藏着只属于你们的亲昵。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[约定闭馆前去图书馆见 (0:04)|Temple]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	细碎香灰飘起，呛得你轻轻打了个喷嚏。<span class="red">悉尼忙递来干净手帕替你拂去鼻尖香灰。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏住呼吸重新清扫 (0:04)|MP Daily Sydney 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回神殿正厅 (0:03)|Temple]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
